# Documentation Standards

## Required Documentation
- [DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md](mdc:DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md) - Development workflow rules
- [docs/CURRENT_BEST_CONFIGURATIONS.md](mdc:docs/CURRENT_BEST_CONFIGURATIONS.md) - Current working configurations
- [docs/CURRENT_STATUS_SUMMARY.md](mdc:docs/CURRENT_STATUS_SUMMARY.md) - Current status summary
- [docs/Nextcloud_OnlyOffice_2domains_baseline.md](mdc:docs/Nextcloud_OnlyOffice_2domains_baseline.md) - Reference baseline

## Documentation Rules
- **Maintain current best versions** of all important configuration files
- Save working configurations as part of project documentation
- Update documentation immediately after fixing something
- Store configurations in version control with clear commit messages
- Never lose working configurations when making changes
- Keep a "golden copy" of each working configuration

## Status Documentation
Always document:
- What's working vs. what's not working
- Current configuration state
- Key findings and insights
- Next steps for troubleshooting
- Regression protection status

## Configuration Documentation
Include:
- Full configuration files
- Status (working/not working)
- Issues resolved
- Current issues
- Test results